# Serpent Isle imported from an Exult saved game (tools/exult2u7.py): the game builds it at
# start-up, then a walk north with the party following, the inventory, a walk east, a save to the
# first slot and the save loaded back, then a walk west.
# Start: STATIC and the converted game as GAMEDAT, made only when EXULT_SAVE_SI names an Exult
# saved game (tests/lockstep/run-all.sh). Arguments: --program si p
#@start si-import
#@args --program si p
6000 shot START.PPM
7000 move 320 20
7100 rdown
10000 rup
11000 shot NORTH.PPM
12000 key i
13500 shot INV.PPM
14000 key esc
15000 move 600 200
15100 rdown
18000 rup
19000 shot EAST.PPM
20000 key s
22000 click 200 27
23000 key I
23200 key m
23400 key p
24000 key enter
26000 shot SAVED.PPM
27000 click 200 27
28500 click 326 157
30000 click 296 109
34000 shot LOADED.PPM
35000 move 20 200
35100 rdown
38000 rup
39000 shot END.PPM
40000 quit
